→ Platinum pick: **[East West Knife Edge Cathedral Solitaire in Platinum at $1,480](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-knife-edge-cathedral-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-311250?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — platinum lifetime metal + east-west cathedral.
→ Pavé-crown statement: **[Cathedral Pavé Crown in 14k Yellow Gold at $1,800 (JA)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/cathedral-pave-crown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315695?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — formal-wear statement, higher snag risk.

**Priority:** apply the Hands-On Lifestyle Test before you buy. Office / formal / low-activity hands = cathedral marquise works beautifully. Medical / mechanical / cooking / childcare hands = pick solitaire or bezel instead. See the full [marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond) for shape fundamentals.

