## How to Verify a Cathedral Marquise Ring Before You Buy

Three checks every ring must pass before you commit.

**Check 1 — Confirm the wearer's lifestyle matches cathedral setting style.** Run the Hands-On Lifestyle Test (3 questions). If any "yes," pick bezel or low-profile solitaire instead.

**Check 2 — Confirm cathedral height matches wearer's activity level.** Low cathedral (3–4 mm) for moderate activity. Medium (4–5 mm) for formal + office. High + pavé for formal wear only.

**Check 3 — Confirm V-tip centre prongs at order.** Cathedral styling does not reduce tip chip risk. V-tip mandatory. [IGI](https://www.igi.org/) and [GIA 4Cs](https://4cs.gia.edu/) verify loose stones only — setting style is on the retailer listing.

I run these three checks before I quote any client on a cathedral marquise. All three must pass for the ring to perform well across the wearer's life.

